As long as you have at least a stack of Sadist whenever you take damage you use [21, 17, 15, 14, 13 (TL1-5)] psi to harness your stacks of Sadist to divide the damage by your stacks + 1.

Each time this happens a random foe in sight with 80% or less life left will take a backlash of [33%, 51%, 62%, 69%, 74% (TL1-5)] of the absorbed damage as mind damage.

This effect can only happen once per turn and only triggers for hits over 10% of your max life.
